# ── GitHub JSON storage ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These point at the PRIVATE DATA repo — not the repo the app is served from.
#
# The code repo is public so GitHub Pages works on a free plan; it contains no
# secret, because the token is never bundled. The data file is a different repo
# and stays private, because it holds both people's body weight and waist/hip
# measurements.
#
# The values below are coordinates, not credentials. The token is the only
# secret, it never goes in here, and each phone pastes its own once at
# Setup -> Sync, PIN and data, where it stays in that browser.
VITE_GH_OWNER=nishadshanid
VITE_GH_REPO=gm-track-data
VITE_GH_BRANCH=main
VITE_GH_PATH=data.json

# Leave the values above empty to run fully local (localStorage only).
